  "comments": "I have found at least 7 different fonts although I do not have the 1992 or 2009 bold coins.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6019dc9974653.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6019dc9974653.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /></a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6019dcaa93152.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6019dcaa93152.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c389f992319f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c389f992319f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br />\r\n1994 160,000,000 KM#111.1 (fine letters; fine reeding, 72 beads)<br />\r\n2009 122,800,000 KM#111.1 (fine letters; coarse reeding, 96 beads)<br /><br />\r\n1994 has 72 beads and 2009 has 96 beads:<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5602fa81d8c8a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5602fa81d8c8a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"98\" /></a><br /><br /><br />\r\nThe easiest difference to see is in the &quot;9&quot;s.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5815cd5445932.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5815cd5445932.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5815cd600c8e7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5815cd600c8e7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nThe difference in letter size exists. Information in World Coins Catalog concerning the different metals used (Brass and Copper-nickel) is wrong: both coin types are Aluminium-bronze.<br /><br />\r\nDifferent varieties exist concerning spacing between denomination letters and the number of beads on the reverse.<br /><br />\r\nImage of 1994 with 72 beads (left) and 96 beads (right)<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5fe7bee645522.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5fe7bee645522.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"250\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2010<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61aa28019d75c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61aa28019d75c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a>",
